<section class="surfdoc-section">
<h1 id="carousel-and-steps">Carousel and steps</h1>
<p>The Elevate pair (0.32.0): a scroll-snap carousel of slides with a dot nav,
and a form whose field groups are steps revealed one at a time.</p>

<section data-block-id="benefits" class="surfdoc-carousel" id="benefits" data-aspect="square"><div class="surfdoc-carousel-track"><article class="surfdoc-carousel-slide" id="benefits-slide-1"><figure class="surfdoc-carousel-media"><img src="/assets/img/hydra-1.webp" alt="Vacuum extractor tip" loading="lazy" /></figure><h3 class="surfdoc-carousel-title">Deep-Cleanse</h3><p class="surfdoc-carousel-body">Vacuum-extracts blackheads &amp; debris in minutes.</p></article><article class="surfdoc-carousel-slide" id="benefits-slide-2"><h3 class="surfdoc-carousel-title">Instant Hydration</h3><p class="surfdoc-carousel-body">Antioxidant-rich serums leave a dewy glow.</p></article></div><nav class="surfdoc-carousel-dots" aria-label="Slides"><a href="#benefits-slide-1" aria-label="Slide 1"></a><a href="#benefits-slide-2" aria-label="Slide 2"></a></nav></section>
<form class="surfdoc-form" data-steps="true"><input type="radio" name="_step" value="1" id="form-step-1" class="surfdoc-form-step-radio" checked/><input type="radio" name="_step" value="2" id="form-step-2" class="surfdoc-form-step-radio"/><div class="surfdoc-form-progress" style="--surfdoc-steps:2" aria-hidden="true"><span class="surfdoc-form-progress-bar"></span></div><fieldset class="surfdoc-form-step" data-step="1"><legend>Step 1 of 2 · What are you interested in?</legend><div class="surfdoc-form-field"><label>Interest <span class="required">*</span></label><select name="interest" required><option value="">Select...</option><option value="Botox">Botox</option><option value="Filler">Filler</option></select></div><div class="surfdoc-form-step-nav"><label for="form-step-2" class="surfdoc-form-step-next">Next</label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="surfdoc-form-step" data-step="2"><legend>Step 2 of 2 · About you</legend><div class="surfdoc-form-field"><label>Full name <span class="required">*</span></label><input type="text" name="full_name" placeholder="" required/></div><div class="surfdoc-form-field"><label>E-mail <span class="required">*</span></label><input type="email" name="e_mail" placeholder="" required/></div><div class="surfdoc-form-step-nav"><label for="form-step-1" class="surfdoc-form-step-prev">Previous</label><button type="submit" class="surfdoc-form-submit">Get Pricing</button></div></fieldset></form>
</section>